Package: causaliflower
Title: Build and Assess Causal Graphs
Version: 0.0.2.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Aidan", "Moller", , "aidan.moller@adelaide.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Extends 'dagitty' and 'ggdag' with functions to build, edit and plot
    causal graphs in R. Also provides guided assessment of causal arrows,
    checks whether causal effects are identifiable, and constructs directed
    acyclic graphs by querying a structural causal model derived from APSIM for
    barley, wheat and maize.
